      "title": "Dividend of ₹2.50 announced",
      "body": "Dividend of ₹2.50 is the same as last year. Ex-date: 13th February 2026 Payment date: 11th March 2026 Dividend yield will be 0.6%, which is higher than the industry average of 0.4%. Sustainability & Growth Dividend is well covered by both earnings (20% earnings payout ratio) and cash flows (17% cash payout ratio). The dividend has increased by an average of 19% per year over the past 10 years. However, payments have been volatile during that time. EPS is expected to grow by 40% over the next 2 years, which should provide support to the dividend and adequate earnings cover.",
